    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "a-farmer",
        "title": "“I am a farmer”",
        "body": [
          "Mu Luganda ogamba **Ndi mulimi**. Mu Lungereza oteekamu **a** (oba **an** nga ekigambo kitandika ne a, e, i, o, u): **I am a farmer. She is an engineer.**",
          "Emirimu mingi gikolebwa okuva ku kikolwa nga oyongerako **-er**: **farm → farmer**, **drive → driver**, **build → builder**. Naye **cook** asigala **cook**."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "do-you-do",
        "title": "Okubuuza omulimu",
        "body": [
          "**What work do you do?** oba **What do you do?** Okuddamu: **I am a trader.** oba **I work in an office.**",
          "**For** kitegeeza “ku lwa”: **I work for a big company.**"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "“Gyebale ko” mu Lungereza",
        "body": [
          "Olungereza terulina kigambo kimu ekitegeeza **Gyebale ko**. Abantu bagamba **Well done!** oba **Thank you for your hard work.**"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
